{"blue-hour": {"stage": "<div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:var(--a1)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Blue Hour logo: the Rise mark and laza wordmark\"><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"88\" r=\"48\" fill=\"#FFD34E\"/><path d=\"M34 126 Q104 200 174 126\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16306B\" stroke-width=\"24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Bricolage Grotesque, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"150\" letter-spacing=\"-9\" fill=\"#16306B\" style=\"font-variation-settings:'wdth' 78\">laza</text></svg><span class=\"cap\">THE RISE: SCOOP \u00b7 SUN \u00b7 SMILE</span></div>", "pal": "<div class=\"pal\">\n        <div class=\"chip big\" style=\"background:var(--a1)\"><b>Laza Sky</b><span>#7FB2F0 \u00b7 7:40pm in July</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--a3)\"><b>Streetlamp</b><span>#FFD34E</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--a2);color:#fff\"><b>Night Ink</b><span>#16306B</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:#B9D6F8\"><b>Soft Sky</b><span>#B9D6F8</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:#C08A57;color:#fff\"><b>Oak</b><span>#C08A57</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3F6F9,#AEB8C4 55%,#EEF2F6)\"><b>Chrome</b><span>finish</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>", "gal": "<div class=\"gal\">\n      <figure class=\"w4 r2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133246_fb164706-e730-4a5f-baba-be270a3824b7.png\" alt=\"Sky-blue corner storefront on 5th Avenue at dusk\"><figcaption>STOREFRONT \u00b7 5TH AVE, BAY RIDGE \u00b7 DUSK</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\" style=\"aspect-ratio:auto\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133241_8fcaba85-c2c5-4c69-802c-dfde3a16decb.png\" alt=\"Round blade sign with rising sun and smile\"><figcaption>BLADE SIGN \u00b7 NO WORD, JUST THE RISE</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w3 r2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133241_46d5e489-1581-44ff-9f24-3f97c2c97230.png\" alt=\"The same vaulted room in 3pm daylight\"><figcaption>THE SKY AT 3PM \u00b7 SAME ROOM, DAY MODE</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w3 r2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133248_47e46340-c033-476a-b6fd-b533c4888a80.png\" alt=\"The vault at 9pm\"><figcaption>THE SKY AT 9PM \u00b7 BLUE HOUR</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133244_116b6438-ccc2-45bd-90ac-c3c7cae7719d.png\" alt=\"Friends on oak bleacher seating\"><figcaption>OAK BLEACHERS \u00b7 SOCIAL SEATING</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133245_ebf3b6f1-b900-4431-9373-7a8940dbe566.png\" alt=\"Sky-blue cup family\"><figcaption>CUP FAMILY</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133241_ff223007-2292-4764-9d3d-9a1e943fe8c2.png\" alt=\"Kunafa box with yellow inside lid\"><figcaption>KUNAFA BOX \u00b7 SUNRISE INSIDE THE LID</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133245_b96c3cbc-f948-4d1a-85f4-a91d79d5a258.png\" alt=\"Team member in sky terry polo\"><figcaption>UNIFORM \u00b7 SKY TERRY POLO + OAK APRON</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133243_7405d340-5bbb-40a4-a9db-12c0bf90f46a.png\" alt=\"Kunafa served on an oak and chrome bar\"><figcaption>CHROME BAR \u00b7 OAK TOP</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/5\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133242_bb5a75ce-b089-4dae-b1ac-2f67737afe16.png\" alt=\"Material board: sky lacquer, oak, chrome, tile, terry, terrazzo\"><figcaption>MATERIALS \u00b7 LACQUER, OAK, CHROME, TILE, TERRY</figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    ", "voice": "<div class=\"voice\"><span style=\"background:var(--a1)\">Stay for the good part.</span><span style=\"background:var(--a3)\">Tonight's forecast: kunafa.</span><span style=\"background:var(--a2);color:#fff\">Bad day? Sit down.</span><span style=\"background:#fff\">Good mood, open till 2.</span></div>", "idea": "<div><p class=\"idea\">La La Land owns golden hour. Laza owns the <b>blue hour</b>: the soft sky after sunset, when the streetlights come on and the night is still ahead. That's exactly when Laza is busiest (it's open until 2am). One clear, airy blue runs across the ceiling, cup, uniform and feed, so the brand always feels like a good night about to start.</p><p class=\"line\">\u201cStay for the good part.\u201d</p></div>", "facts": "<div class=\"facts\">\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Agency lens</p><p><b>Koto</b>: a palette named after a place and a time. <b>Wolff Olins for Blank Street</b>: time-of-day color. <b>La La Land</b>: one hue across costume and set.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">WOW moment</p><p><b>The Sky</b>: a lacquered barrel vault whose cove lighting runs on the store's hours, from daylight blue at 2pm to blue hour at 8pm to deep blue with warm table light at 1am.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Owned without the logo</p><p>The Sky ceiling \u00b7 the Rise shape in chrome \u00b7 Laza Sky with Streetlamp yellow</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>", "hero": "<div class=\"hero\"><img src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133248_47e46340-c033-476a-b6fd-b533c4888a80.png\" alt=\"Laza interior at 9pm under a glowing sky-blue barrel vault with chrome bar and oak bleacher seating\">"}, "ahlan": {"stage": "<div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:var(--b1)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 320\" style=\"max-width:380px\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ahlan logo: scalloped tray badge with laza in Latin and Arabic\"><g fill=\"#F8F7F3\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"160\" r=\"143\"/><circle cx=\"298\" cy=\"160\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"291.2\" cy=\"202.6\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"271.6\" cy=\"241.1\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"241.1\" cy=\"271.6\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"202.6\" cy=\"291.2\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"298\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"117.4\" cy=\"291.2\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"78.9\" cy=\"271.6\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"48.4\" cy=\"241.1\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"28.8\" cy=\"202.6\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"160\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"28.8\" cy=\"117.4\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"48.4\" cy=\"78.9\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"78.9\" cy=\"48.4\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"117.4\" cy=\"28.8\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"22\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"202.6\" cy=\"28.8\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"241.1\" cy=\"48.4\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"271.6\" cy=\"78.9\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"291.2\" cy=\"117.4\" r=\"20\"/></g><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"160\" r=\"112\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F08A2B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"1 9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Young Serif, serif\" font-size=\"76\" fill=\"#0F3550\">laza</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Lalezar, sans-serif\" font-size=\"62\" fill=\"#F08A2B\">\u0644\u0630\u0629</text></svg><span class=\"cap\">THE TRAY \u00b7 BILINGUAL, EQUAL WEIGHT</span></div>", "pal": "<div class=\"pal\">\n        <div class=\"chip big\" style=\"background:var(--b1)\"><b>Tile Blue</b><span>#4FB0E0 \u00b7 glazed tile</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--b3)\"><b>Kunafa</b><span>#F08A2B</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--b5)\"><b>Rose Syrup</b><span>#F5A3B7</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--b2);color:#fff\"><b>Deep Tile</b><span>#0F3550</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:#B98252;color:#fff\"><b>Oak</b><span>#B98252</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:#fff\"><b>Chalk</b><span>#F8F7F3</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>", "gal": "<div class=\"gal\">\n      <figure class=\"w4 r2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133603_f51c8e86-0ec1-4d20-a2fc-8b2fc3fdadad.png\" alt=\"Tile storefront with scalloped orange awning on Steinway Street\"><figcaption>STOREFRONT \u00b7 STEINWAY ST, ASTORIA</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\" style=\"aspect-ratio:auto\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133648_27abf0d9-7d0e-47ea-a056-df5af7529019.png\" alt=\"Host welcoming guests in blue shirt and orange apron\"><figcaption>THE HOST \u00b7 \"AHLAN\" AT THE DOOR</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w3 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133559_d2d9e2ca-965e-4281-b0e9-ccc8911faae8.png\" alt=\"Strangers and families sharing a long oak table\"><figcaption>THE SOFRA \u00b7 ONE LONG SHARED TABLE</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w3 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133602_872abf56-e0e1-4cdc-8105-fb24e366a0ee.png\" alt=\"Round scalloped kunafa box with rose ribbon\"><figcaption>THE TRAY BOX \u00b7 A GIFT TO CARRY HOME</figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    ", "voice": "<div class=\"voice\"><span style=\"background:var(--b1)\">Ahlan. Come as you are.</span><span style=\"background:var(--b3)\">Pulled to order. Watched by everyone.</span><span style=\"background:var(--b5)\">Always room for one more.</span><span style=\"background:var(--b2);color:#fff\">You're family now.</span></div>", "idea": "<div><p class=\"idea\">In the Levant you're welcomed before you're served. Ahlan takes the loud, generous sweet shop of Nablus and Damascus, with trays in the window, strangers talking across counters and kunafa flipped in front of you, and rebuilds it for Bay Ridge and Astoria at 1am. Moose's line, \"they make you feel seen\", is Arabic hospitality, and here it becomes the brand.</p><p class=\"line\">\u201cCome as you are. Leave sweeter.\u201d</p></div>", "facts": "<div class=\"facts\">\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Agency lens</p><p><b>Mythology</b>: the store is the story. <b>Media.Monks</b>: one hero object becomes the social prop. Precedent: <b>Common Breads</b>, London (MA Studio).</p></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">WOW moment</p><p><b>The Pull Bar</b>: a tile-clad kunafa counter at the entrance, where trays are flipped and cheese is pulled under one spotlight. A chrome turntable of trays sits in the window.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Owned without the logo</p><p>The scalloped tray edge \u00b7 the Pull Bar \u00b7 Tile Blue glaze \u00b7 \"ahlan\" at the door</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>", "hero": "<div class=\"hero\"><img src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133605_4fa8c6fe-8926-48b7-8a89-fe7bb5c64707.png\" alt=\"Baker pulling kunafa cheese at a blue glazed tile counter at night\">"}, "pool-club": {"stage": "<div class=\"stage\" style=\"background-color:var(--c1);background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.55) 2px,transparent 2px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.55) 2px,transparent 2px);background-size:28px 28px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 320\" style=\"max-width:380px\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pool Club logo: quartered lifebuoy ring with laza\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"160\" r=\"110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"56\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"160\" r=\"110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F5FA8\" stroke-width=\"56\" stroke-dasharray=\"172.79 172.79\" stroke-dashoffset=\"86.39\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"160\" r=\"138\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F5FA8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"160\" r=\"82\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F5FA8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Bowlby One, sans-serif\" font-size=\"54\" fill=\"#1F5FA8\">laza</text></svg><span class=\"cap\">THE RING \u00b7 LIFEBUOY / SCOOP FROM ABOVE</span></div>", "pal": "<div class=\"pal\">\n        <div class=\"chip big\" style=\"background:var(--c1)\"><b>Pool Tile</b><span>#A9DDF3 \u00b7 the shallow end</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--c2);color:#fff\"><b>Deep End</b><span>#1F5FA8</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--c3)\"><b>Lemon Float</b><span>#FFE36E</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#1F5FA8 0 12px,#fff 12px 24px);color:#1F5FA8\"><b style=\"background:#fff;align-self:flex-start;padding:0 4px\">Cabana</b></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:#C99A64;color:#fff\"><b>Deck Oak</b><span>#C99A64</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3F6F9,#AEB8C4 55%,#EEF2F6)\"><b>Chrome</b><span>ladder rails</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>", "gal": "<div class=\"gal\">\n      <figure class=\"w4 r2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133600_14a51c51-e7a7-4ad1-a8df-1351e6475785.png\" alt=\"Storefront with blue and white cabana-striped awning\"><figcaption>STOREFRONT \u00b7 CABANA AWNING</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\" style=\"aspect-ratio:auto\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133558_f61eb09e-05e2-4da1-b591-ed6941ec700e.png\" alt=\"Friends on the tiled steps of the pit\"><figcaption>IN THE PIT</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w3 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133600_8416cb90-a977-4701-bdb3-09766b2f3e8e.png\" alt=\"Cabana-striped cups on pool tile\"><figcaption>CABANA CUPS + RING STICKER</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w3 cardfig\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#1F5FA8;color:#fff\"><div style=\"padding:28px;display:grid;gap:14px;justify-items:start\"><span style=\"font:500 11px var(--f-m);letter-spacing:.1em\">MEMBERSHIP CARD \u00b7 FREE</span><span style=\"font:400 clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px)/1 'Bowlby One',sans-serif\">laza pool club</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;max-width:34ch\">Everyone gets a card on their first visit. Five punches pays out a kunafa. It's a loyalty program that feels like belonging.</span></div></figure>\n    </div>\n    ", "voice": "<div class=\"voice\"><span style=\"background:var(--c1)\">Everyone's a member.</span><span style=\"background:var(--c3)\">Get in. The pit's warm.</span><span style=\"background:var(--c2);color:#fff\">Deep end open till 2.</span><span style=\"background:#F2F9FD\">No lifeguard on duty. Just dessert.</span></div>", "idea": "<div><p class=\"idea\">Moose asked for a day-club feeling without looking like a club. The answer is the other kind of club: the summer pool club, where everyone lounges together and the mood is permanently July. At its center is a sunken, tiled conversation pit. You don't take a table, you get in. It's membership energy with no membership.</p><p class=\"line\">\u201cEveryone's a member.\u201d</p></div>", "facts": "<div class=\"facts\">\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Agency lens</p><p><b>Red Antler</b>: one friendly symbol plus packaging that surprises. Slim Aarons, updated. Precedent: <b>Daughter</b>, Crown Heights, with its indoor stoop seating.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">WOW moment</p><p><b>The Pit</b>: an oval about 45 cm deep, lined in pool tile, with chrome ladder rails. About 18 guests face each other, so social energy is built in. A level rim ring keeps it accessible.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Owned without the logo</p><p>The Pit \u00b7 cabana stripe \u00b7 the quartered Ring \u00b7 ladder-rail chrome</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>", "hero": "<div class=\"hero\"><img src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133602_96fd8f21-8333-40fc-8646-8b3f3b9b7bd2.png\" alt=\"Sunken pale-blue tiled conversation pit with chrome ladder rails in a bright caf\u00e9\">"}, "radio": {"stage": "<div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:var(--d1)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 320\" style=\"max-width:360px\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Laza Radio logo: radio dial from 2pm to 2am with cherry needle and laza wordmark\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"160\" r=\"150\" fill=\"#F3F4FA\"/><g stroke=\"#1A1F4A\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"76.6\" y1=\"243.4\" x2=\"65.2\" y2=\"254.8\"/><line x1=\"53.7\" y1=\"211.2\" x2=\"39.3\" y2=\"218.1\"/><line x1=\"42.7\" y1=\"173.2\" x2=\"26.8\" y2=\"175\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"133.7\" x2=\"29.4\" y2=\"130.2\"/><line x1=\"60.1\" y1=\"97.2\" x2=\"46.5\" y2=\"88.7\"/><line x1=\"86.4\" y1=\"67.7\" x2=\"76.5\" y2=\"55.2\"/><line x1=\"121\" y1=\"48.6\" x2=\"115.7\" y2=\"33.5\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"199\" y1=\"48.6\" x2=\"204.3\" y2=\"33.5\"/><line x1=\"233.6\" y1=\"67.7\" x2=\"243.5\" y2=\"55.2\"/><line x1=\"259.9\" y1=\"97.2\" x2=\"273.5\" y2=\"88.7\"/><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"133.7\" x2=\"290.6\" y2=\"130.2\"/><line x1=\"277.3\" y1=\"173.2\" x2=\"293.2\" y2=\"175\"/><line x1=\"266.3\" y1=\"211.2\" x2=\"280.7\" y2=\"218.1\"/><line x1=\"243.4\" y1=\"243.4\" x2=\"254.8\" y2=\"254.8\"/></g><g font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#1A1F4A\"><text x=\"89.3\" y=\"235.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2PM</text><text x=\"89.3\" y=\"94.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"230.7\" y=\"94.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"230.7\" y=\"235.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2AM</text></g><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"243.1\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#E4414F\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"160\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#E4414F\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Unbounded, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#1A1F4A\">laza</text></svg><span class=\"cap\" style=\"color:#fff\">THE DIAL \u00b7 2PM \u2192 2AM, LAZA'S REAL HOURS</span></div>", "pal": "<div class=\"pal\">\n        <div class=\"chip big\" style=\"background:var(--d1);color:#fff\"><b>Frequency Blue</b><span>#6C8CFF \u00b7 on air</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--d3);color:#fff\"><b>Cherry</b><span>#E4414F \u00b7 the needle</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:var(--d2);color:#fff\"><b>Vinyl</b><span>#1A1F4A</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:#fff\"><b>Studio White</b><span>#F3F4FA</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:#B5834F;color:#fff\"><b>Speaker Oak</b><span>#B5834F</span></div>\n        <div class=\"chip\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3F6F9,#AEB8C4 55%,#EEF2F6)\"><b>Chrome</b><span>knobs, counter</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>", "gal": "<div class=\"gal\">\n      <figure class=\"w4 r2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133601_5bb5e041-57e9-40f0-a132-9a3fef13c5de.png\" alt=\"Periwinkle storefront with round window and dial sign at night\"><figcaption>STOREFRONT \u00b7 THE DIAL SIGN</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w2 r1\" style=\"aspect-ratio:auto\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133648_503f8b8a-3cd1-4d80-bee9-581887f3067c.png\" alt=\"Team member in periwinkle crew jacket\"><figcaption>CREW JACKET \u00b7 UNIFORM = MERCH</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w3 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133649_c77ea4d0-2188-49a9-818a-5accdb023186.png\" alt=\"Friends dancing and laughing at a small table\"><figcaption>11PM \u00b7 THE ROOM HAS ENERGY</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"w3 r1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133649_948bf8b5-22e0-4311-a086-b428ba73b9d6.png\" alt=\"Kunafa box printed like a record sleeve with cup\"><figcaption>RECORD-SLEEVE BOX \u00b7 CHERRY LID</figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    ", "voice": "<div class=\"voice\"><span style=\"background:var(--d1);color:#fff\">Good mood, on air till 2am.</span><span style=\"background:var(--d3);color:#fff\">Request line's open.</span><span style=\"background:var(--d2);color:#fff\">This one's for the bad day.</span><span style=\"background:#fff\">Now playing: kunafa.</span></div>", "idea": "<div><p class=\"idea\">Moose described people who \"come in, talk, laugh, listen to music, then continue their night.\" Laza Radio makes music the social glue. Every store is a friendly listening bar for dessert, with a record wall, a real booth, guest selectors on weekends and one station playing in every Laza. You don't just visit, you tune in.</p><p class=\"line\">\u201cGood mood, on air till 2am.\u201d</p></div>", "facts": "<div class=\"facts\">\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Agency lens</p><p><b>Media.Monks</b>: the brand as a content engine that makes culture, not ads. <b>Mimi's</b>: merch as a lifestyle label, here the crew jacket.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">WOW moment</p><p><b>The Record Wall</b>: an oak wall of about 1,500 records with two big speakers and a booth behind a chrome counter. An ON AIR box lights at 2pm and goes dark at 2am.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Owned without the logo</p><p>The Dial \u00b7 the record wall \u00b7 menu as tracklist \u00b7 the 1:30am closing set</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>", "hero": "<div class=\"hero\"><img src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2xojXnccJM2OM83CuOEuH3U88is/hf_20260929_133600_2d5fb9c1-fbb9-4fcd-8c8b-fcde3ba8a680.png\" alt=\"Listening-bar dessert caf\u00e9 with vinyl wall, chrome counter and periwinkle light\">"}}